# Crashpad intentionally discovers libcurl with dlopen() on Linux. Give the
# handler a Bazel-owned shared object and runtime search path so it does not
# depend on an ambient system libcurl. The anchor's undefined curl_version
# reference keeps the dynamic dependency despite the handler's dlsym-based API.
